  "instructions": [
    "Drain and rinse the chickpeas and place them in a large bowl.",
    "Add the halved cherry tomatoes, diced cucumber, and thinly sliced red onion to the bowl.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley and mint.",
    "Squeeze the fresh lemon juice over the mixture and pour in the olive oil.",
    "Sprinkle the sumac, smoked paprika, salt, and pepper on top.",
    "Gently toss everything together until evenly coated.",
    "Rest the salad for 5 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "Serve chilled or at room temperature with a drizzle of extra olive oil if desired."
  ],
